  "instruction": "What are the primary factors that influence consumer behavior?",
  "result": {
    "INDEX-1<SEP>What are the primary factors that influence consumer behavior?<SEP>The primary factors that influence consumer behavior are motivation, ability, and desire. Motivation is what drives consumers to make a purchase. Ability is the consumer's resources and skills that allow them to make a purchase. Desire is the consumer's wants or needs that make them want to buy something.": -6.5625,
